  <!-- Research Section -->
  <section id="research">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Research</h2>
      <p class="lead">Chemists and biologists working together on health problems, combining design, synthesis and biological validation.</p>
      <div class="topics">
        <div class="topic">
          <h3>Smart MRI probes</h3>
          <p>Fe(II) macrocycles as pH-responsive PARACEST agents, and Fe(III)-catecholate complexes as dual-modal T1 MRI and optical agents for nitric oxide and acidic tumour pH.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic">
          <h3>Oxygen activation</h3>
          <p>Fe(II), Ni(II) and Cu(II) complexes as models for cysteine dioxygenase and copper monooxygenases, studied with spectroscopy and computation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic">
          <h3>CO₂ activation</h3>
          <p>Bioinspired Cu(II) and Ni(II) complexes that fix atmospheric CO₂ under mild conditions and convert it into cyclic carbonates and carboxylic acids.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

